WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.220
Women are looked at in a different way.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:35.930
Nobody expect them being
soldiers, fighting, being spies.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.200
When you go into a place, for instance,

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.760
where everybody knows each other,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.370
and you are supposed
to collect information,

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.030
when a guy goes into a place like that,

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:50.810
straight away, people will
start looking suspiciously.

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:53.680
Women can do the same thing
and people might look at them,

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.690
but will not think that
they're doing something

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.610
that they're not supposed to.

00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.150
That's the difference.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.067
And women can use that.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.287
Women come to me and say to me,

00:01:16.287 --> 00:01:20.030
"I always dreamed of being a spy.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:23.560
I've always dreamed to
be somebody like you."

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.870
I look at them and I say, "You know what?

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:28.380
It's not what you think it is

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:32.300
because it's a lot of
moments of being in places

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.310
that you don't really want to be at.

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.550
Like when you watch
somebody, day and night,

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.610
you just sit and watch.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.030
It's not easy. It's not fabulous.

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:43.230
It's not a fantasy.

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:47.273
You can find yourself in weird
place, doing weird things.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:51.630
And all you want is to go back
home, to be with your kids."

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.900
Women see things and remember details.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.140
One of the first jobs that I
did, I was supposed to wait

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.890
for a woman coming off a bus.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:04.050
I didn't know who she
was. I never had a name.

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:06.840
She was a very pretty girl.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.360
With her was a guy much older than her.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.550
And you follow people at their back.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:14.480
So you see their backs most of the time.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.360
At one stage, the guy
and the woman stopped

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.504
underneath the lights of the street.

00:02:20.504 --> 00:02:22.050
The guy took out a pipe,

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.850
lit his pipe, and continued walking.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:27.050
And they went into where we
thought they were going to.

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:29.433
So we thought the job was finished.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.620
That evening, I was told
that I was supposed to go

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.780
to the airport to pass that woman

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.220
to another group of people.

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:39.000
I said easy enough, okay, let's go.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.100
Went to the airport.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.910
And I looked at this couple
who looked very similar

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:47.010
to what I remembered, but
it was a big difference.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.230
He was much older

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:51.320
and she, she wasn't as pretty,
her face wasn't smooth,

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.230
it had pimples on it.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.350
'Cause when I saw her, you
know, the light wasn't strong.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.810
She looked so beautiful.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:01.110
But in real life, she
was completely different,

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.420
and he was too.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.080
Nobody else had come.

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.460
So I said to the guy
next to me, I said, "Look

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.769
I think it's those two.

00:03:08.769 --> 00:03:12.540
But to make sure that they are,

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.760
if the guy takes his pipe out,"

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.927
and I explained to him how
the pipe looked exactly,

00:03:17.927 --> 00:03:19.227
"then you know it's them."

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.450
Thank God it was.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:25.260
He took out the pipe, job done.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.390
And I remembered it for some reason.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.670
I didn't tell myself,
"Oh, look at this pipe.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.230
Remember what it looks like."

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.460
It just goes through your
head and you remember,

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.380
so women see these details,

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:40.130
we remember these details and
information that men don't.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.060
When I started, I was very young, 21.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.950
I was a shy girl from a small village.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.740
I wasn't educated.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.720
I didn't do much with my life.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.083
And I learned how to think.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.810
And I learned how to judge people.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.310
And I learned how to look at things

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.203
and to be broad-minded.

00:04:12.203 --> 00:04:14.590
You become a different person.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.410
And that's who I became.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.360
And that's who I am today.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.870
I think differently.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:24.703
It gave me a lot of security
in myself and who I am.

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:26.930
I'm proud.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.740
I used to, I wasn't like that.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.010
I'm proud of who I am.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.120
If you're a spy and you hear what I say,

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.283
you know and understand me
much better than all the rest.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:40.750
After I quit my job as a
spy, I took time to heal

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.943
because you give up a lot of your life.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:48.980
As a wife, as a mother, and
you have to heal the family,

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:50.430
and you have to heal yourself

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.236
to become a normal person again.

